[{"c":"OSCR 2021 Q1","e":"oscr","d":"2021-05-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mario Schlosser","x":"…Oscar as the insurance company, the providers on our virtual care platform, and our members by offering downstream cost savings for those members using virtual care and attributing themselves to an Oscar virtual primary care physician -- an Oscar Medical Group virtual primary care physician.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/14/oscar-health-inc-oscr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"OSCR 2021 Q3","e":"oscr","d":"2021-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott Blackley","x":"So first of all, on COVID, our prior guidance, we increased our guidance last quarter for direct COVID costs, we've roughly doubled what we had previously assumed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/11/oscar-health-inc-oscr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"OSCR 2021 Q4","e":"oscr","d":"2022-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mario Schlosser","x":"…insurance companies who are realizing that, as I said in my prepared remarks here, the healthcare system is inevitably going to -- it demands more frictionless provider experience and where we can really help both take the cost out and enable them to put more innovative plan designs out there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/oscar-health-inc-oscr-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"OSCR 2021 Q4","e":"oscr","d":"2022-02-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Cornelia Miller","x":"Thank you for joining us for our fourth quarter and year-end earnings call, where we'll discuss our financial results, the benefits of our increasing scale and reaffirm our 2022 outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/oscar-health-inc-oscr-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"OSCR 2021 Q4","e":"oscr","d":"2022-02-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott Blackley","x":"Today, I'm going to walk through in more detail the 2021 results, and I'll reaffirm our 2022 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/oscar-health-inc-oscr-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"OSCR 2022 Q1","e":"oscr","d":"2022-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mario Schlosser","x":"In terms of driving down total cost of care, we are executing on several key areas for medical cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/11/oscar-health-inc-oscr-q1-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"OSCR 2022 Q2","e":"oscr","d":"2022-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Blackley","x":"And from what we've seen, we're seeing that the more experienced players in the market seem to be on the upper end of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/12/oscar-health-inc-oscr-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"OSCR 2022 Q2","e":"oscr","d":"2022-08-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott Blackley","x":"We have delivered against our 2022 plan through the first half of the year, and we are reiterating our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/12/oscar-health-inc-oscr-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"OSCR 2022 Q2","e":"oscr","d":"2022-08-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott Blackley","x":"Based on the results to date and our forecast for the second half, we are reaffirming our guidance across all of our metrics for 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/12/oscar-health-inc-oscr-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"OSCR 2025 Q4","e":"oscr","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark Bertolini","x":"Oscar investments in AI are creating efficiencies across the business as we grow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/oscar-health-oscr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSCR 2026 Q1","e":"oscr","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Bertolini","x":"We are reaffirming our full year guidance and remain on track to deliver meaningful profitability in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/oscar-health-oscr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"OSCR 2026 Q2","e":"oscr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark Bertolini","x":"As far as AI goes, internally, our investment is not something that we do separately.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/06/oscar-health-oscr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSCR 2026 Q2","e":"oscr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark Bertolini","x":"As a result, we start with a huge advantage in being able to use AI at scale without having to make the investments in platform integration and data rationalization that a lot of our competitors do.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/06/oscar-health-oscr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSCR 2026 Q2","e":"oscr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Bertolini","x":"You can see that we reaffirmed our full year guidance on revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/06/oscar-health-oscr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSCR 2026 Q2","e":"oscr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Richard Blackley","x":"And we raised guidance by $250 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/06/oscar-health-oscr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSCR 2026 Q3","e":"oscr","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard Blackley","x":"Our relative price increase this year was probably a bit lower than some of our competitors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/oscar-health-oscr-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OSCR 2026 Q3","e":"oscr","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard Blackley","x":"So we've already got a very advanta